  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Organization of a 3-day regional workshop in Suva, Fiji entitled: &#x201c;Regional Indo-Pacific workshop on oceans economy, plastic pollution, and plastic substitutes&#x201d; including related substantive and logistical elements. The workshop will assist countries in the Indo-pacific region to better understand material substitutes as part of solutions under SDG 14.1 and 12. The activity will also assist in building a stronger voice of Pacific Nations in multilateral processes on plastic pollution, including</narrative>
